description: Write the UI spec (spec/UI_SPEC.md + spec/tasks.md) for ONE captured screen from outputs/<screen>/ â€” facts.md, content.md, the user's screenshots and the state pictures â€” so the screen can be rebuilt in React 19 with the same looks and behavior. Use when asked to "write the UI spec for <screen>", "spec <screen>", or to fix a failing `npm run check`. Not for capturing (that is `npm run capture`) and not for writing the React code.
